  "description": {
    "de": "The humus form classes arise from the succession of organic soil horizons and present details about the circumstances in which the organic material is transformed at a specific location. Hence, the assigned humus form is determined through a morphological account of the traits of the organic soil matter in the field, such as colour, level of decay and blend, and scent."
  },
